#: vfs.docbook:8
#. Tag: title
#, no-c-format
msgid "Virtual file systems (VFS)"
msgstr "आभासी सञ्चिकातन्त्राणि (VFS) २."

#: vfs.docbook:10
#. Tag: primary
#, no-c-format
msgid "<primary>VFS</primary>"
msgstr "<primary>VFS</primary> इति"

#: vfs.docbook:12
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"A basic <link linkend=\"features\">OFM feature</link> is VFS, this an "
"abstracted layer over all kinds of archived information (ZIP files, &FTP; "
"servers, TAR archives, &NFS; filesystems, SAMBA shares, ISO &CD;/&DVD; "
"images, RPM catalogs, &etc;), which allows the user to access all the "
"information in these divergent types of filesystems transparently - just "
"like entering an ordinary sub-folder. &krusader; supports several virtual "
"file systems:"
msgstr ""
"एकः मूलभूतः<link linkend=\"features\"> OFM विशेषता</link> VFS अस्ति, एतत् "
"सर्वविधसंग्रहीतसूचनानाम् (ZIP सञ्चिकाः, &amp;FTP; सर्वरः, TAR संग्रहणः, "
"&amp;NFS; सञ्चिकातन्त्राणि, SAMBA साझाः, ISO &amp;CD;/&amp;DVD; चित्राणि, "
"RPM सूचीपत्राणि, &amp; इत्यादयः) उपरि अमूर्तस्तरः, यत् उपयोक्तारं अनुमतिं "
"ददाति एतेषु विविधप्रकारस्य सञ्चिकातन्त्रेषु सर्वाणि सूचनानि पारदर्शकरूपेण "
"प्राप्तुं - यथा साधारणं उपपुटं प्रविष्टुं । &amp;krusader; अनेकाः "
"आभासीसञ्चिकातन्त्राणि समर्थयति:"

#: vfs.docbook:23
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<link linkend=\"remote-connections\">Remote connections VFS</link>: "
"provides the capability of working with a remote connection session (&FTP;, "
"&NFS;, Samba, FISH, SFTP) like with local filesystems. It is perfect for "
"complex remote operations and almost as powerful as most standalone &GUI; "
"remote clients."
msgstr ""
"<link linkend=\"remote-connections\">दूरस्थसंयोजनानि VFS</link> : "
"स्थानीयसञ्चिकातन्त्रेषु इव दूरस्थसंयोजनसत्रेण (&amp;FTP;, &amp;NFS;, Samba, "
"FISH, SFTP) सह कार्यं कर्तुं क्षमताम् प्रदाति । इदं जटिलदूरस्थसञ्चालनानां "
"कृते परिपूर्णं भवति तथा च अधिकांशस्य स्वतन्त्रस्य &amp;GUI; दूरस्थग्राहकाः।"

#: vfs.docbook:32
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<link linkend=\"archives\">Archive VFS</link>: allows to browse archives in "
"VFS as it was a folder (ace, arj, bzip2, deb, gzip, iso, lha, rar, rpm, "
"tar, zip and 7-zip)."
msgstr ""
"<link linkend=\"archives\">अभिलेखागार VFS</link> : VFS मध्ये अभिलेखान् "
"ब्राउज् कर्तुं शक्नोति यतः एतत् एकं फोल्डर् आसीत् (ace, arj, bzip2, deb, "
"gzip, iso, lha, rar, rpm, tar, zip तथा 7-zip) ।"

#: vfs.docbook:38
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<link linkend=\"archives\">Search VFS</link>: <guibutton>Feed to "
"listbox</guibutton> places the search results in VFS."
msgstr ""
"<link linkend=\"archives\">VFS इति अन्वेषणं कुर्वन्तु</link> : "
"१.<guibutton> सूचीपेटिकायां फीड् कुर्वन्तु</guibutton> अन्वेषणपरिणामान् VFS "
"मध्ये स्थापयति ।"

#: vfs.docbook:44
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<link linkend=\"synchronizer\">Synchronizer VFS</link>: places the "
"synchronizer results in VFS."
msgstr ""
"<link linkend=\"synchronizer\">समन्वयक VFS</link> : समन्वयकपरिणामान् VFS "
"मध्ये स्थापयति ।"

#: vfs.docbook:49
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Actions you perform on the files in VFS are performed on the 'real' files. "
"You do not just delete files from the VFS - you delete them from your hard "
"drive. Limitations: you cannot create folders inside a VFS."
msgstr ""
"VFS मध्ये सञ्चिकासु भवता क्रियमाणानि क्रियाणि 'वास्तविक' सञ्चिकासु "
"क्रियन्ते । भवान् केवलं VFS तः सञ्चिकाः न विलोपयति - भवान् तान् स्वस्य "
"हार्डड्राइवतः अपास्यति । सीमाः : भवान् VFS इत्यस्य अन्तः पुटं निर्मातुम् न "
"शक्नोति ।"

#: vfs.docbook:53
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"It is possible to keep the folder structure when doing a copy from a "
"virtual folder to a non virtual folder, by selecting the <quote>Keep "
"virtual folder structure</quote> check box of the copy dialog. Imagine the "
"following virtual folder: <screen><prompt>$</prompt> "
"<userinput>file:/home/myhome/mydir1/myfile1</userinput></screen> "
"<screen><prompt>$</prompt> "
"<userinput>file:/home/myhome/mydir1/myfile2</userinput></screen> "
"<screen><prompt>$</prompt> "
"<userinput>file:/home/myhome/mydir2/myfile3</userinput></screen> Then do "
"the following steps:"
msgstr ""
"आभासीपुटतः अ-आभासीपुटं प्रति प्रतिलिपिं कुर्वन्, प्रतिलिपिसंवादस्य "
"<quote>Keep virtual folder structure</quote> इति चेकबॉक्सं चित्वा, "
"पुटसंरचनां स्थापयितुं शक्यते निम्नलिखित आभासीपुटस्य कल्पनां कुरुत: "
"<screen><prompt>$</prompt> "
"<userinput>file:/home/myhome/mydir1/myfile1</userinput></screen> "
"<screen><prompt>$</prompt> < "
"userinput>सञ्चिका:/home/myhome/mydir1/myfile2</userinput></screen> "
"<screen><prompt>$</prompt> इति "
"<userinput>file:/home/myhome/mydir2/myfile3</userinput></screen> ततः "
"निम्नलिखितपदार्थाः कुर्वन्तु ।"

#: vfs.docbook:63
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid "go to the virtual folder and select the files"
msgstr "वर्चुअल् फोल्डर् गत्वा सञ्चिकाः चिनोतु"

#: vfs.docbook:66
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid "select a destination folder (non virtual!)"
msgstr "गन्तव्यपुटं चिनोतु (अ आभासी!) ।"

#: vfs.docbook:69
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid "press <keycap>F5</keycap>-&gt; copy dialog appears"
msgstr "<keycap>F5</keycap>-&gt; प्रतिलिपिसंवादः दृश्यते"

#: vfs.docbook:74
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid "Check <guilabel>Keep virtual folder structure</guilabel>"
msgstr "<guilabel>आभासीपुटसंरचनां रक्षतु</guilabel> इति परीक्ष्यताम्"

#: vfs.docbook:78
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid "Select <filename>/home/myhome/</filename> for base &URL;"
msgstr "आधारस्य कृते <filename>/home/myhome/</filename> इति चिनोतु &URL;"

#: vfs.docbook:83
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid "Start copy by pressing OK"
msgstr "ठीकं नुत्वा प्रतिलिपिं आरभत"

#: vfs.docbook:86
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid "The result will be:"
msgstr "परिणामः भविष्यति : १."

#: vfs.docbook:87
#. Tag: screen
#, no-c-format
msgid "<prompt>$</prompt> <userinput>destinationdir/mydir1/myfile1</userinput>"
msgstr "<prompt>$</prompt> <userinput>गन्तव्यdir/mydir1/myfile1</userinput>"

#: vfs.docbook:88
#. Tag: screen
#, no-c-format
msgid "<prompt>$</prompt> <userinput>destinationdir/mydir1/myfile2</userinput>"
msgstr "<prompt>$</prompt> <userinput>गन्तव्यdir/mydir1/myfile2</userinput>"

#: vfs.docbook:89
#. Tag: screen
#, no-c-format
msgid "<prompt>$</prompt> <userinput>destinationdir/mydir2/myfile3</userinput>"
msgstr "<prompt>$</prompt> <userinput>गन्तव्यdir/mydir2/myfile3</userinput>"
